power.balanced = Balanced
power.balanced.desc = Good for most games, including GBA, SNES and PlayStation.
power.performance = Safe performance
power.performance.desc = Up to 1.8 GHz, the manufacturer's rated maximum. Runs warmer and uses more battery.
